OL,3,ASecond buyer makes rescue bid for
OL,4,APoundland as retailer faces collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second buyer has made a rescue bid
OL,7,Ffor Poundland as the discount retailer
OL,8,Fteeters on the brink of collapse, with
OL,9,Fthousands of jobs at risk.
OL,11,FLondon-based Xyra Group has offered to
OL,12,Fpay off half of Poundland's outstanding
OL,13,Fdebts - a key sticking point in
OL,14,Ftakeover talks so far - immediately.
OL,15,FThe rest would be deferred.
OL,17,FWith Poundland close to collapse,
OL,18,FUS-based owners Gordon Brothers have
OL,19,Falready rejected a rival bid from an
OL,20,FIrish property group which would have
OL,21,Fsaved its 12,000 staff.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,114,105,200,300,0,100
